            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqa kad'ad'a, aka inni hojja wogaani geetu isanii roobu. Nami dumansa bokayatiifi sorro namaa erge oobru ch'ufa dotteesu isuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami waaqoota d'ara ta harkaani mid'aasani ira wo eegate nama wo himule wo gaafata, ammo dubbi d'araatiifi ta woma keesa injirre iti himani. Nami gari waan oobjuuni d'ooftu hima, ammo d'uga ira isani gorsa; worri sunini qarqaarsa woma imbaanne isanii keenna. Tanaafi biyyiti aka hooliye badde yayaati, aka nama nama tissu inqamne, gaargalti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Anini nyaapa amma gumi tiyya tissu ya iti dallane, gaargalchu male illakisu. Worri Yuda kiyya, ana, AABBO Waaqa Guddati qorqorata. Worri fardoole tiyya ta lolaa taha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worra keesaa jaallaba, makala, hayyoota, ta worra kiyya fiduti, gabaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Yuda nyaapa ufii dabsata, aka worra duulaa ka nyaapa dabsate aka d'oqe lafati d'id'iitu. Worri waan AABBO Waaqa woliini jirufi, nyaapa had'e worra fardaani worra had'ule dabsata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka nama nama dabsu balleesani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
